> +          with no children.
> +        $ref: '#/$defs/placements'
> +      suggested-reply-length:
> +        description: |
> +          Query only. An omitted value is CTLV_DEFAULT_QUERY_REPLY_LEN raised
> +          to the computed minimum. A declared value must be between that
> +          minimum and CTLV_MAX_INLINE_MESSAGE_LEN.
