The upper bound 1048576 hard-codes `CTLV_MAX_INLINE_MESSAGE_LEN`. The same
limit is then enforced a second time in `spec.py` (`_u32_value()`) and a third
time in `sizes._suggested_len()`. Three copies of one constant (plus
`sizes.MAX_INLINE_MESSAGE_LEN`) will drift.

