`generated-files-schema.yaml` has no $id, unlike the other two meta-schemas,
and its path pattern ^[^/].*$ accepts "../x", ".hidden" and non-normalized
paths; `outputs._relative()` re-validates all of that in Python. Either
tighten the pattern or drop one of the two checks.

