    ones (priv_size, init, fini) always, the optional ones (pre_init,
    post_init, pre_fini) only when the family declares them. .stub_ops and
    .stub_ops_count are emitted only when the family fills inherited
    extension points, and refer to the array written by _stub_ops. The
    export is the one symbol an inheriting family's module needs from this
