`_validate_syntax()` reloads and re-parses the meta-schema YAML and builds a
new Draft7Validator on every call (each spec in a chain, the registry, each
manifest, each output); there is no `check_schema()` on the schema, and
`best_match()` reports a single error. With the chain walking in
`semantics._load_chain()` and `outputs.render()` reloading every family per
output, a full `--outputs-check` loads each file many times. Cache the
validators.

